2276|a|Of or pertaining to synergism. ; Cooperating; synergetic.	j:xo,115,3~xo,115,3
227t|n|One of two or more words (commonly words of the same language) which are equivalents of each other; one of two or more words which have very nearly the same signification, and therefore may often be used interchangeably. See under Synonymous.	a:22f7,39,7;211r,36,2;w53,5,3~22f7,39,7;w53,5,3;211r,36,2	n:22f7,57,26~22f7,57,26	N:211v,53,6;211u,45,3;1h1s,37,4;22f7,26,3~211v,53,6;1h1s,37,4;22f7,26,3;211u,45,3
