22an|a|Of or relating to a system; common to a system; as, the systemic circulation of the blood. ; Of or pertaining to the general system, or the body as a whole; as, systemic death, in distinction from local death; systemic circulation, in distinction from pulmonic circulation; systemic diseases.	j:gaw,134,10~gaw,134,10
